WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
So the great state of Michigan, which I won decisively in the last election,

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:15.320
is looking seriously, I guess, at a man named Muhammad Abdul El-Sayed, who is absolutely

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:23.000
Muslim Brotherhood. The last thing we need is Muslim Brotherhood in the United States Senate.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:29.920
It doesn't represent the values of Michigan, and it doesn't represent the values of the

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:38.060
United States of America. You have a man named Mike Rogers. He's 100%. He has my complete and

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:44.640
total endorsement. He'll be a great senator. You cannot even think about putting Mohammed Al-Sayed

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:51.540
in that position. He's a disaster and he hates our country. Thank you, Michigan. I love you.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:59.080
And thank you for voting me through. You gave me such a great early lift because the polls,

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.920
right from the beginning were great for me,

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.000
and I appreciate it.

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:03.880
And then we went on to a big win.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.820
So thank you very much.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.680
Do not allow Mohammed al-Sayed

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.300
to take a position in the United States Senate.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.260
It would be the beginning of the end for our country.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.100
Thank you.
